This numeric adapter adapts the TabSyn training loops from amazon-science/tabsyn
commit cb5ac0f74ec36ee88e7a974a393dfbef50d42da7. The associated license and
original notice are preserved in tabsyn-adapter.LICENSE and tabsyn-adapter.NOTICE.

Changes: numeric-only empty-category loss, explicit configuration and deadline
checks, isolated zero-worker loaders, safe artifact serialization and inventory,
seeded repeated direct sampling, guarded original native-evaluator dispatch,
and rejection of unadmitted real/GPU execution. Author model definitions and
sampler implementations are imported from separately pinned original source.
